### Feature SupplyOrderItem — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### DELETE lógico (is_active = false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/insumo-pedido-detalles/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/insumo-pedido-detalles/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
